sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Client
    participant GSLB as Global routing
    participant RA as Region A
    participant RB as Region B
    participant Cap as Capacity model
    U->>GSLB: request
    GSLB->>RA: nearest healthy region
    RA-->>U: response
    Note over Cap: every region carries N+1 — losing one must not overload the rest
    GSLB->>RA: health probe fails
    GSLB->>RB: shift that traffic
    alt region B has headroom
        RB-->>U: served, slightly higher latency
    else capacity is short
        RB->>RB: degrade — smaller model, shorter context, or queue
        RB-->>U: a slower answer beats no answer
    end
